# Excluded from the release zip. Everything not listed here SHIPS —
# resources/ deliberately ships whole: primitives.css, ba-colors.css,
# symbol-defs.svg and vendor/magnific-popup are read at runtime, not bundled
# by Vite. Trimming resources/css out of a zip is what broke staging once.
